&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;239&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Engineering Manager, Containers at the Edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;291&quot;&gt;The Containers at the Edge team is responsible for architecting, deploying, and managing our distributed container infrastructure at the edge in support of customer workloads. As Senior Engineering Manager of the team, you will hire and lead a high-performing engineering team to ensure low latency, high availability, and secure application delivery across a geographically diverse fleet of thousands of resource-constrained nodes. You will foster a culture of technical rigor, operational excellence, and innovation across the entire platform domain, moving beyond single-team execution to driving cross-organizational advancements. While reliability is critical, innovation is key to success -driving strategic improvements, building foundational team processes and software systems that continually evolve..&lt;/p&gt;
