&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;Define the long-term strategic vision and multi-year technical roadmap,ensuring these investments align with Fastly’s overall business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Hire and develop a high-performing team that includes software engineers, principal-level individual contributors and SREs, focusing on organizational structure, talent development, and scaling team capabilities to meet future demand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders using a product-owner mindset to define clear roadmaps and priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Clearly communicate the strategy, progress, and risk profile to executive leadership and technical stakeholders across the company&lt;/p&gt;
