&lt;p&gt;The Mission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the engine that powers our partners’ growth. You are not here to &quot;manage a channel.&quot; You are here to build a repeatable, scalable, and automated sales machine. You are a Builder-Seller: an expert who understands our technical product well enough to handle introductory, product focused conversations, and a hunter who knows how to drive the sales outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ecosystem is primarily composed of VARs, MSPs, and SIs. Your success is defined by their success. You are the architect of that relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Scoreboard (Lag Measures)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success is binary and measurable. You own these three outcomes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Bookings: You are accountable for the revenue generated through your partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner-Sourced Pipeline: You are the bridge. We don&#39;t want &quot;fluff&quot;; we want high-quality, qualified opportunities formally accepted by Fastly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Active/Engaged Partners: We prioritize depth over breadth. You own the health and activity level of your partner portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Daily Work (Lead Measures)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t get the outcomes above without the inputs. You are expected to operate with high agency on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-Selling: You are in the room. You provide the technical and sales support to help partners close their deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enablement: You ensure our partners’ teams are smarter than our competitors’. You deliver the playbooks, training, and technical confidence they need to lead with Fastly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-Marketing: You execute &quot;Marketing to, through, and with&quot; your partners. You don&#39;t just &quot;do&quot; marketing; you drive pipeline-generating events and campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Machine Building: You identify the operational &quot;bugs&quot; in our deal registration or onboarding processes and you fix them. You don&#39;t wait for permission; you build the better way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Individual We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deeply Technical, Commercially Driven: You can explain WAF, bot detection, and edge infrastructure to an engineer, then switch gears to explain the financial model (rebates, margins, MDF) to a business owner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder-at-Heart: You prefer fixing an underlying process once for everyone over executing a manual workaround ten times. You use data to identify where the friction is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-Agency Owner: You don’t need a task list. You see a gap in partner engagement, you build the fix, and you report the result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ecosystem Fluent: You have significant experience working with VARs, MSPs, and SIs. You understand the unique economics of their business and how to make Fastly a foundational part of their service offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
