&lt;h3&gt;Senior Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging Manager&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a detailed-oriented and motivated individual to join the Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging team. You are a strategic problem solver, thrive at building monetization strategies and enjoy a fast-paced &amp;amp; high-growth environment. Your role will be pivotal in driving long-term growth by executing pricing, packaging, and monetization initiatives across Fastly’s product portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Product team build and define strategies and product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead pricing &amp;amp; packaging programs increase revenue and growth, capitalize on strengths and mitigate challenges for products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End-to-end commercialization and operationalization delivering programs from concept to launch partnering with Sales and Marketing, Legal, Finance, Business systems and others, owning every step along the way driving consensus cross-functionally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct qualitative and quantitative research to test strategy hypotheses, review and analyze pricing trends and discounting, validate customer&#39;s willingness to pay and product positioning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research buyer motivations, analyze performance data and market trends to drive frequent iteration of pricing for Fastly&#39;s products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
