&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to thrive and form well-reasoned opinions from multiple perspectives and limited information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer focused, seeking a deep understanding of target users and are adept at understanding their problems and arriving at elegant solutions to those problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self directed, highly motivated and intellectually curious to tackle complex challenges and deliver discernible impact on the business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great presentation, communication and influence skills that tell a cohesive story and drive consensus to decision making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Foundational understanding of accounting and revenue recognition principles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
