&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will require you to be available during core business hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
