&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Development Engineer - API Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The API Services team owns critical services to ensure the performance and reliability of Fastly&#39;s Control Plane. As a Software Development Engineer, you will implement features and improvements to these high-throughput, globally distributed systems, working closely with more senior engineers and other internal Fastly teams to support critical components of our infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement projects and features that require interaction with neighboring systems, working across groups to solve issues and implement changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and facilitate team discussions, respecting and incorporating differing opinions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide useful design and code review feedback to your teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the core infrastructure and platform needs of the team by working with tools and frameworks like Terraform, Jenkins, Kubernetes, and Chef&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve manual tasks into more reliable, automated systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard and support new team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the lead in solving problems of diverse scope, with guidance from senior teammates as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 1-3 years of related development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of GoLang, with a desire to build deeper hands-on expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud providers (AWS, GCP), containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), and infrastructure as code (Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of core engineering concepts within your functional area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to execute on features that require interaction with neighboring applications or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing understanding of distributed systems and microservices architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking on well-scoped projects with support from senior teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great teammate: communicative, collaborative, empathetic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn new domains, grow your skills, and take on more scope over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to working with teams distributed across different time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;ll be super impressed if you have experience in any of these:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envoy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API Gateways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Varnish, VCL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
